<title>BELGIUM: EU raises maize import duty.</title>
<headline>EU raises maize import duty.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union raised its import duty on distant maize to 76.31 Ecu per tonne from 65.80 Ecus per tonne effective on Tuesday, the European Commission said on Monday.  </p>
